Z||000013||FieroGT||06-15-2000||04:59 PM||||I agree!!!!<P>I really think that men and women are two completely different species, sometimes. Maybe it's some kind of cruel joke from the guy upstairs.....<P>You know how people say that &lt;insert female anatomy here&gt; drives men crazy? Whel just think about what it does to women, because they're attached to it!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I'm done for today!<P>John||||reg||14
Z||000014||FieroGTGirl||06-16-2000||03:19 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, lucidatypewriter">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroGT:<P><BR>...I really think that men and women are two completely different species, sometimes. Maybe it's some kind of cruel joke from the guy upstairs.....<P><BR>John<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yes I agree with you on ONLY THAT, FieroGT...<P><B>burdell1~~~~What are you thinking??</B> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  It is MEN who make us this way!!!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <P>Seriously though... We really do think differently!  There are times I really wonder if you guys came from a different planet. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> I guess that is what makes marriage fun and exciting.  It is one he!! of a roller coaster ride!  And for some reason, I LOVE IT!!<BR> <BR>(Love ya, Coconut) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <P>Kristina  <P>||||reg||1
